7. Wiring frontend to backend (high level)
Contact page: POST to /contact

FAQ page: optionally fetch from /content/faq instead of hardcoding

Privacy / Terms pages: optionally fetch from /content/privacy and /content/terms

You already have strong liability language on the frontend; this backend mirrors that tone and makes sure nothing looks like a guarantee or professional advice.

If you want, next step can be: hook this backend into your Hermis stack and J‑Roc Core Intelligence Engine, but for “website + legal + not held liable,” this backend is enough to stand behind the frontend you’ve got.
